# Bundle payload cache. The .NET 10 Desktop Runtime EXE is fetched at
# build time from a SHA512-pinned URL (see Directory.Build.props +
# ZenVizor.Bundle.wixproj's FetchDotnetRuntimePayload target). Cached
# here so repeat builds skip the download. Do not commit — the pin
# guarantees reproducibility, the cache is just a local optimisation.
payloads/
